  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>For smooth incline,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>g</mi><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></math><br /><br />For rough incline,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mi>v</mi><mi>n</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#956;</mi><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo></math></p><p>On solving (1) and (2), we obtain,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi>tan</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></math></p>"
